Note on hsq (Higher Subleq compiler):

The Higher Subleq compiler "hsq.cpp" by Oleg Mazonka (2009-2011,
originally published at http://mazonka.com/subleq/) is NOT distributed
in this repository, because its author has not published license terms.
This repository only contains "hsq64.patch", our 64-bit modification,
which is licensed under the MIT License above. The build system
downloads the original hsq.cpp from a public archive and applies the
patch locally (see Makefile).
